## Getting started

Install dependencies:

```bash
uv sync --extra dev
```

Run the CLI:

```bash
# Via module
uv run python -m src.main hello --name World

# Via installed entry point
uv run {{ .Name | replace "-" "_" }} hello --name World
```

Run tests:

```bash
uv run pytest
```

Lint:

```bash
uv run ruff check .
```

## Adding a new command

1. Create `src/commands/<command_name>.py`:

```python
import typer

def my_command(
    name: str = typer.Option("World", "--name", "-n", help="Input value"),
) -> None:
    """Command description."""
    typer.echo(f"Hello, {name}!")
```

2. Register in `src/main.py`:

```python
from src.commands import my_command
app.command()(my_command.my_command)
```

